  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算機概論實習",
    "sub_ename": "THE  PROGRAMMING LABORATORY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目標在教授C++語言及程式設計。課程內容包含C++語言的資料型態、控制結構、函式、檔案處理。學生將被要求練習現場的課堂作業和定期的程式作業。本課程將配合計算機概論之教學。",
    "describe_eh": "The goal of this course is to teach C++ programming language and program design. The course subjects include C++ language data types, control structures, functions, and file processing. Students are required to do programming practice in class and take-home program assignments. The course will be taught with INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTER.The APP Inventor is applied as a application development tool, including total of 18 hour classes.",
